    {
      "source": "Post-process the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/ConfigurableEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>ConfigurableEnvironment</code></a> by copying appropriate\nsettings from a parent <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/ConfigurableEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>ConfigurableEnvironment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通过从父级 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/ConfigurableEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>ConfigurableEnvironment</code></a> 复制适当的设置，对给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/ConfigurableEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>ConfigurableEnvironment</code></a> 进行后处理。",
