    {
      "source": "An <a href=\"../EnvironmentPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>EnvironmentPostProcessor</code></a> that replaces the systemEnvironment\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/SystemEnvironmentPropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>SystemEnvironmentPropertySource</code></a> with an\n<a href=\"SystemEnvironmentPropertySourceEnvironmentPostProcessor.OriginAwareSystemEnvironmentPropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.support\"><code>SystemEnvironmentPropertySourceEnvironmentPostProcessor.OriginAwareSystemEnvironmentPropertySource</code></a> that can track the\n<a href=\"../origin/SystemEnvironmentOrigin.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>SystemEnvironmentOrigin</code></a> for every system environment property.",
      "translation": "一个 <a href=\"../EnvironmentPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>EnvironmentPostProcessor</code></a>，它将系统环境<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/SystemEnvironmentPropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>SystemEnvironmentPropertySource</code></a>替换为能够跟踪每个系统环境属性的<a href=\"SystemEnvironmentPropertySourceEnvironmentPostProcessor.OriginAwareSystemEnvironmentPropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.support\"><code>SystemEnvironmentPropertySourceEnvironmentPostProcessor.OriginAwareSystemEnvironmentPropertySource</code></a>，从而记录每个系统环境属性的<a href=\"../origin/SystemEnvironmentOrigin.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>SystemEnvironmentOrigin</code></a>。",
